U\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe mesh receiving the decal immediately turns dark/unshaded.\nConsole floods with ShaderGLES3::_version_get_uniform: Parameter \"spec\" is null.\nSetting `light.shadow_enabled = false` resolves the bug immediately.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6710bb31-ed43-4641-bd75-8164a9da1631\n\nUsing Forward+ also resolves the bug.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d88fedf8-958a-4bff-a157-2c682386ab27\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a scene with a simple room mesh (CSGBox3D or ArrayMesh) and an OmniLight3D.\nSet `light.shadow_enabled = true`.\nSpawn a Decal on any surface of the mesh.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[decalissue.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32702331/decalissue.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123887/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123887/timeline","performed_via_git